    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the darkness take you\"... what does that even mean? like, if everything is just a series of random, meaningless events, then isn't there really any difference between being here and not being here? it feels like it's just a math problem at this point. if the net value of living is zero or negative, then why is staying alive considered the \"right\" answer?",
